{"data": [{"author_id": "1558995886478606337", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:59:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120320444939354506"], "id": "2120320444939354506", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai 我的 agent 跟同事的 agent 在一个工作区里协作，听着很爽。我最担心两个 agent 同时改同一个文件，到底听谁的。人跟人撞车还能喊一嗓子，agent 撞车可能要等 CI 红了才发现。冲突怎么裁、有没有锁，这块没讲清楚之前我不敢让全组一起开。", "url": "https://x.com/leehoo48415921/status/2120320444939354506"}, {"author_id": "159446317", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:59:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120320421702897678"], "id": "2120320421702897678", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1031397619728187393", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120320331005260281", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@jonsegov @cursor_ai @jacobgold That’s fire", "url": "https://x.com/chrislciaba/status/2120320421702897678"}, {"author_id": "1031397619728187393", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:58:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120320331005260281"], "id": "2120320331005260281", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai @jacobgold @chrislciaba now this is multiplayer", "url": "https://x.com/jonsegov/status/2120320331005260281"}, {"author_id": "1981279476802592768", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:57:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120319992600436976"], "id": "2120319992600436976", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai shared context is only half of multiplayer. explicit task ownership and a clean merge/review gate are what keep parallel agents from turning into a faster conflict queue.", "url": "https://x.com/monstarxco/status/2120319992600436976"}, {"author_id": "925021", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:56:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120319839197872634"], "id": "2120319839197872634", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai can't wait for the first fight that's just two agents silently undoing each other's commits", "url": "https://x.com/davidbt/status/2120319839197872634"}, {"author_id": "2111980571261820928", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:56:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120319612256735595"], "id": "2120319612256735595", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai The hard part of working with more than one agent isn't starting them, it's keeping them from stepping on each other. A shared workspace where they can coordinate would help a lot if you can still see what each one did and correct it", "url": "https://x.com/ezenrIA/status/2120319612256735595"}, {"author_id": "1713177895", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:55:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120319537568698843"], "id": "2120319537568698843", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai No！stupidly method to use one unified workspace", "url": "https://x.com/dev_zh/status/2120319537568698843"}, {"author_id": "2081275014918389760", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:51:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120318418041930018"], "id": "2120318418041930018", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 124, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai if i were to switch entirely to cursor today how easy is it to port over my claude or codex setup? can i use claude sub in cursor?", "url": "https://x.com/erickb336/status/2120318418041930018"}, {"author_id": "2080521898623160320", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:50:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120318200999293066"], "id": "2120318200999293066", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai Multiplayer agents get messy fast once two of them touch the same file or branch. Curious whether Projects serializes agent actions or just surfaces conflicts for a human to resolve.", "url": "https://x.com/ModelPlaneHQ/status/2120318200999293066"}, {"author_id": "1218081281797279746", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:50:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120318118727655631"], "id": "2120318118727655631", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai Two teammates' agents in one workspace is the first time an agent gets to blame another agent", "url": "https://x.com/lozoboss/status/2120318118727655631"}, {"author_id": "912641810148745217", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:47:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120317451015471276"], "id": "2120317451015471276", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai Running multiple agents is one thing. Getting teammates’ agents to work together without humans copy-pasting context is the interesting part.\n\nCurious how Projects handles interface changes and conflicting decisions—and when it hands those decisions back to a human.", "url": "https://x.com/yolohair/status/2120317451015471276"}, {"author_id": "1887985641734258688", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:46:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120317270065078520"], "id": "2120317270065078520", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai Teammates' agents working together is where this was always going. We've been building the chat side of it at https://t.co/S3ewVXGpfN: people and their agents in one group thread.", "url": "https://x.com/summer_ikiki_/status/2120317270065078520"}, {"author_id": "2108739599594070016", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:45:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120317076783210944"], "id": "2120317076783210944", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai 以前协作最容易各写各的：规则散在个人会话里，进组后再对口径。更稳的是进组前先锁三件事——任务谁认领、共享 Context 只放全组约定、个人偏好不进共享层。公开门槛是 Cloud Agents 计划、同一 team、客户端 ≥3.26.13。这版我还没实测，建议先把边界写清再发邀请。", "url": "https://x.com/JunRudjnf/status/2120317076783210944"}, {"author_id": "174353514", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:45:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120317017031122991"], "id": "2120317017031122991", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai the group chat era of coding is finally here and honestly its about time. solo debugging was getting lonely", "url": "https://x.com/soElsaxMae/status/2120317017031122991"}, {"author_id": "2041731664112463872", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:44:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120316681461588464"], "id": "2120316681461588464", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1695890961094909952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120295553309565139", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cursor_ai when two teammates' agents flag a conflict, does the human behind each one get a say, or do the agents settle it between themselves?", "url": "https://x.com/illulachy_/status/2120316681461588464"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1558995886478606337", "name": "leehoo", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 108, "following_count": 301, "like_count": 588, "listed_count": 1, "media_count": 66, "tweet_count": 533}, "username": "leehoo48415921"}, {"id": "159446317", "name": "Christian Ciabattoni", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 828, "following_count": 1048, "like_count": 5541, "listed_count": 3, "media_count": 170, "tweet_count": 3640}, "username": "chrislciaba"}, {"id": "103139761972818